    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Huanu Poems</strong> It is a pure single-player game that does not require an Internet connection. Out of a common hobby,We tried to adopt the style and gameplay of the classic pure love GALGAME,Three GE\u3001Multi-BE\u3001There is also a male protagonist with two cats hidden TE line needs to be manually excavated... The game features a number of screenwriters, photographers, voice actors, and musicians to create the game in an unauthored way, including nearly 200 high-definition CG photos, 5 costumes, 5 kinds of cameras and hidden audio for collection. There will also be a VR mode that will be updated soon <br>\u00b7 Meet the four catgirls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196550/extras/7d378f42f50bbd9c18734e48ad92303d.poster.avif?t=1743654591\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196550/extras/7d378f42f50bbd9c18734e48ad92303d.webp?t=1743654591\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=256 /></picture></span>*<strong>Peach</strong>  Equivalent to 18 years of human age. Chinese rural Dragon Li cat. She is lively, cute, honest, and loyal. One bite of cat food and she will stay with you for the rest of her life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*<strong>Cloudia</strong>  Equivalent to 19 years of human age. Ragdoll cat, gentle and clingy, its beauty is a virtue least worth mentioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*<strong>Zhizhi</strong>  Equivalent to 19 years of human age. Chinchilla cat, it\u2019s not easy to please this gorgeous and aloof little princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*<strong>Meimei</strong>  Equivalent to 18 years of human age. American Shorthair Munchkin cat, lively, cute, brave, aggressive, fun-loving even if she\u2019s not good at it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7Multi-branch interactions that need quick responses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196550/extras/0b5a5bd378a891b8d3d114457609f062.poster.avif?t=1743654591\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196550/extras/0b5a5bd378a891b8d3d114457609f062.webm?t=1743654591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196550/extras/0b5a5bd378a891b8d3d114457609f062.mp4?t=1743654591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Respond to their strange problems and emergency situations at lightning speed, cats don\u2019t have that much patience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7A plot with multiple endings that does not rely on likability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196550/extras/e134b5f7939dd40acf0900f5fb675697.poster.avif?t=1743654591\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196550/extras/e134b5f7939dd40acf0900f5fb675697.webm?t=1743654591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196550/extras/e134b5f7939dd40acf0900f5fb675697.mp4?t=1743654591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>There\u2019s no likability in life, your choices are like sliding doors, each step leading towards different destinies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7Press the shutter at the right time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196550/extras/9046207989b49a078b8ed069de1de0fc.poster.avif?t=1743654591\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196550/extras/9046207989b49a078b8ed069de1de0fc.webm?t=1743654591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196550/extras/9046207989b49a078b8ed069de1de0fc.mp4?t=1743654591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use an old fixed-lens camera to take photos at the right time. If the photo is blurry, you will be laughed at!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7 ONE MORE THING: Photo Studio</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience taking photos in a professional photo studio. Only those who become her owner will have the opportunity to take photos for her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196550/extras/84b893d1d9ff0ac994b38cef1845fdc5.poster.avif?t=1743654591\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196550/extras/84b893d1d9ff0ac994b38cef1845fdc5.webm?t=1743654591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196550/extras/84b893d1d9ff0ac994b38cef1845fdc5.mp4?t=1743654591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>*Clear Peach\u2019s storyline, Cloudia\u2019s storyline, and/or Duo storyline to unlock the opportunity to take photos of the corresponding catgirl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*If you clear all three storylines above, you will unlock the opportunity to take photos for all four catgirls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*In addition to the basic outfits, there are four more outfits that need to be unlocked in the hidden ending.</p>",
