    "short_description": "Huanu Poems is a multi-ending love adventure game. As a photographer, carrying the secret of being a bloodline inheritor of HuaNu Town, you will take lovely Peach to run a B&amp;B, encounter gentle Cloudia. Your choices will affect the direction of the story.",
    "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, English<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cWhat a uniform! JK white silk, other movie games have been used, this real cat-eared girl is still the first time. Four girls meow with you and call the master. The theme is unique, and it is very in line with the aesthetics of two-dimensional players, which makes people feel bright. There are broadcasts with still picture dialogue, which is more like a traditional GAL game style. The girl's full voice dialogue. The full-story experience takes about 7 hours. The title Flower Slave Ling feels too urbane, and it might be better if it could directly highlight the Catwoman theme.\u201d<br>Recommended \u2013 \u7504\u6e38\u7ec4<br><br>\u201cThe game's writers are particularly commendable, as the plot development does not rely on simple numerical growth, but instead requires the player to progress the story through &quot;heart-to-heart interaction&quot;, making every choice even more important. The multi-branch, multi-ending design greatly enriches the gameplay, and even after trying multiple routes, you can still discover new possibilities and weave a complex and engaging story web. While keeping the single-line plot short, it is interspersed with various mini-games and photo sessions, which not only adds to the fun, but also does not make the player feel lengthy or boring.\u201d<br>Recommended \u2013 \u7b2c\u4e00\u5370\u8c61<br>",
